OL,3,GNEWSARugby honours 'Mr Music' with
OL,4,Aplaque by park bandstand
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis son Keith Ward, who has led efforts
OL,7,Fto get a permanent memorial to his
OL,8,Ffather, said: "He was also a co-founder
OL,9,Fof the Rugby Theatre and started the
OL,10,Ftown's RAG (Raise and Give) Festival,
OL,11,Fwhich is still going. He'd be very
OL,12,Fproud of the memorial."
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
